Cell["\<\
The four sections above sit on top of these twelve calls. Anywhere a \
symmetry-resolved tensor network needs sizing, block enumeration, or \
constraint enforcement, the right call is one of them.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c471262e-a8ec-4316-a545-0b10a028ec90"]
},
